  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4342c41f37a5b85438fd2d1c2f0fc4ed, type: 3}
  m_Name: LoreIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LoreSequenceSO
  paragraphs:
  - Minos, the guardian of the gates of Hell has been corrupted by Lucifer.
  - Now the realm of Minos, the Limbo has become a shadow of what it once was.
  - "With the terrible influence of Lucifer\xB4s corruption, the souls within the
    limbo have been morphed beyond recognition... <br> ...now, even angels fear entering
    the Limbo and fall under it's corruption."
  - The archangel Azrael, as a last ditch resort, has sent the soul of Remiel, the
    purest one he has ever seen to the Limbo instead of Heaven, hoping that she will
    stand against the corruption and liberate the Limbo.
